#: /home/claude/repo/TTMediaBot-Cross-platform/bot/__init__.py:186
msgid ""
"The bot is starting an update process and will restart shortly. It may go"
" offline at any moment."
msgstr ""
"Bot sedang memulai proses pembaruan dan akan segera dimulai ulang. Bot "
"bisa offline sewaktu-waktu."

#: /home/claude/repo/TTMediaBot-Cross-platform/bot/__init__.py:216
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Python packages of the update could not be installed: {error}. Run "
"pip install -r requirements.txt on the bot's computer, then send rs to "
"restart the bot."
msgstr ""
"Paket Python untuk pembaruan ini tidak dapat dipasang: {error}. Jalankan "
"pip install -r requirements.txt di komputer bot, lalu kirim rs untuk "
"memulai ulang bot."

#: /home/claude/repo/TTMediaBot-Cross-platform/bot/__init__.py:249
msgid "The bot is restarting now to apply the update. See you in a moment!"
msgstr ""
"Bot dimulai ulang sekarang untuk menerapkan pembaruan. Sampai jumpa "
"sebentar lagi!"

